WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:10,020
Want to be angry with Wanyue

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,020
But he didn’t dare to have an attack at all

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:33,690
After all, I was the one who asked Wanyue to go work.

4
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:37,420
I want to ask how Xiaoyue is doing

5
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,420
I stayed with you all night yesterday

6
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:46,370
Is it time to go back?

7
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:47,370
Look at my brain

8
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,370
They all forgot about it

9
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:51,620
My sister-in-law worked hard last night and this morning

10
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,620
Keep my house very clean

11
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:53,620
I'm very satisfied

12
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:56,390
I'm tired after working all night

13
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,390
Go back and rest quickly

14
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,960
No, no

15
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:03,280
I still haven't cleaned the kitchen and bathroom.

16
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,280
I won’t go back today, husband

17
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,280
It's cold outside

18
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,280
You should go home quickly

19
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,470
This woman is very sensible

20
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:18,310
This is today

21
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:19,310
thank you thank you

22
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:20,310
Since it's not finished

23
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,310
Then Xiaoyue, just keep busy.

24
00:01:21,310 --> 00:01:22,310
I won't bother you anymore
